WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.489 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
想投几只股票，

00:00:01.747 --> 00:00:02.194 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
却不知道从哪看起？

00:00:02.194 --> 00:00:03.125 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
加入自选，

00:00:03.387 --> 00:00:04.764 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
打开信息导图。

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.512 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
博主为什么看多？

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:08.079 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
点到原话。

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:09.260 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
习惯看K线？

00:00:09.522 --> 00:00:10.349 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
顺手就能看。

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:11.492 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
再看佩洛西披露：

00:00:11.492 --> 00:00:12.411 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
交易记录，

00:00:12.639 --> 00:00:14.338 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
直接连到原始文件。

00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:15.813 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
每天相关消息，

00:00:15.813 --> 00:00:17.145 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
AI帮你梳理，

00:00:17.403 --> 00:00:18.470 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
留在你的

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:20.077 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
投资时间线里。

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.915 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
每天检查超跌，

00:00:22.173 --> 00:00:23.081 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
设好提醒。

00:00:23.343 --> 00:00:25.122 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
再回放两个例子。

00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:27.073 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
罗宾汉董事

00:00:27.073 --> 00:00:28.988 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
买入披露后，

00:00:28.988 --> 00:00:31.662 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
二十个交易日
涨了四成。

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:34.227 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
诺基亚合作消息后，

00:00:34.524 --> 00:00:36.326 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
回落到五块八毛七，

00:00:36.508 --> 00:00:37.553 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
后来到十块零三。

00:00:37.867 --> 00:00:38.808 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
少翻消息，

00:00:39.067 --> 00:00:40.066 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
把时间留给自己。

00:00:40.328 --> 00:00:41.579 line:84% position:50% size:94% align:center
Ducky，免费关注一只。
